<p>Python offers a versatile ecosystem of libraries for data science, machine learning, and statistical computing. <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/blog/r-benefits-in-data-science/">R</a> is widely used for statistical analysis and data visualization. <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/blog/sql-in-data-science/">SQL</a> is vital for interacting with databases and extracting relevant data.</p>
