<p><strong>Bar Plot:</strong> A bar plot is a graph in which categorical data is represented by rectangular bars.</p>
<p>For the bar plot, you need to define values on the x and y axes and plot the bar plot using the plt.bar(x,y) function.</p>
<p><img src="https://tumfgdyurswklrzsnevv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/uploads/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/image3-e1718260774218.png" alt="bar plot in python visualization"></p>
<p><img src="https://tumfgdyurswklrzsnevv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/uploads/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/bar-graph.png" alt="bar plot in python visualization"></p>
