<p>Explore our signature <strong>data science courses in collaboration with <em>Electronics &#x26; ICT Academy, IIT Guwahati</em></strong>, and join us for experiential learning to transform your career.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/data-science-specialization-course/">Data Science 360 Certification Course</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/pg-in-data-science/">PG in Data Science</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Broaden your learning scope with our elaborate <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/machine-learning-course-certification-training/">machine learning</a> and <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/deep-learning-with-python/">deep learning</a> courses. Explore our <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/courses">ongoing courses here</a>.<br>
Learn the right skills to fully leverage AI’s power and unleash AI’s potential in your data findings and visualization. Have a question? <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/contact-us">Connect with us here</a>. Follow us on social media for regular data updates and course help.</p>
<h2><strong>AI and ML are significant in the field of data analytics!</strong></h2>
<p>Both AI and ML are extremely important for data analysts as now they have to deal with enormous data sets. Quintillion bytes of data is being generated every day and acquired by enterprises to dig crucial information out of such data sets. However, for a data analyst it can be a humongous task to analyze such massive data sets which are most often unstructured. Thus, AI and ML are used by a skilled data analyst to automate the process or devise systems capable of automatic data analytics.</p>
<p>This is exactly why most data analytics jobs today mention AI or ML as required skills. But should you consider going for <strong>Machine learning and artificial intelligence courses in India</strong>?</p>
<h2><strong>Perks of acquiring AI and ML skills</strong></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Future-proof jobs</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>One of the greatest benefits of acquiring AI and ML skills is that it will enable you to get a job which is absolutely future-proof and you will be needed to switch your career any soon. It is now feared that AI and ML will take away many jobs but we must also keep in mind that AI and ML will create many more jobs but for such jobs AI and ML skills are essential</p>
<ul>
<li>**Highly paid job roles<br>
**Acquiring AI and ML skills will help you to land on jobs which are highly paid. For instance an ML expert in India can earn around Rs 871K per annum (according to glassdoor) A data scientist or a data analyst with AI or ML skills can earn even higher that that!</li>
